# ── What this repo is ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# A `git clone` must land everything shadcn.md tells an agent to use:
#   INDEX.tsv / INDEX.json   → finding components
#   registry/**              → the component source itself
#   docs/**                  → per-component docs
#   assets/**                → images and fonts the components reference
#   CLAUDE.md, shadcn.md, .claude/skills/  → the agent instructions
# Everything ignored below is build/verification machinery or regenerable input,
# none of which the prompt workflow touches.

# ── Verification harness ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# node_modules, the pnpm store, the Vite app and its cache. Exists only to PROVE
# the archive works, not to USE it. Rebuild: cd _verify && pnpm install
_verify/
node_modules
.vite/

# ── Upstream repo clone ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# A nested .git commits as an unusable gitlink. Nothing in shadcn.md references
# it; registry/ and docs/ already carry the extracted content. Restore with:
#   git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui.git upstream
upstream/

# ── Working data ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The build SCRIPTS and small reports in _work/ are kept: they document how the
# archive was made and are what reapply-rewrites.mjs replays from. The heavy
# inputs and outputs are not.

# raw registry JSON; registry/ is the extracted, usable form
_work/raw/
_work/node_modules/

# throwaway project used to capture the skill (contains a nested .git)
_work/_skilltmp/

# repo files re-fetched during analysis; superseded by upstream/
_work/code/

# per-file verification results; COVERAGE.md carries the summary
_work/c5-results*.jsonl

# superseded by the committed manifest.json
_work/manifest.jsonl

# regenerated by index-build.mjs / renderable.mjs
_work/fileindex.json
_work/renderable.json

_work/*.log

# exact duplicates of the top-level docs/ and skills/ trees
_work/docs/
_work/skills/

# throwaway components.json fixtures used to probe style resolution
_work/basetest/

# nested .git from the direct-capture clone; SKILL content is kept in skills/
skills/_direct/github-shadcn-ui-ui-skills/.git/

# raw fetched artifacts from the license research; the distilled findings
# alongside them, and licenses/ at the root, are what THIRD-PARTY.md relies on
_work/licenses/raw/
_work/licenses/_raw/
_work/licenses/_raw2/

# ── Generated by bootstrap.sh ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# registry/ and assets/ are fetched from upstream on first run; the large index
# files are derived from them. INDEX.tsv stays committed so components can be
# found before the first bootstrap.
registry/*
!registry/.gitkeep
assets/*
!assets/.gitkeep
INDEX.json
INDEX-compact.json
manifest.json

# ── Bootstrap scratch ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Only the stage scripts, their tests and the stage reports are kept.
_work/bootstrap/raw/
_work/bootstrap/tmp-registry/
_work/bootstrap/assets-baseline/
_work/bootstrap/enum/
_work/bootstrap/manifest.jsonl
_work/bootstrap/reference.json
_work/bootstrap/assets-baseline.json
_work/bootstrap/assets-run.json
_work/bootstrap/state.json
_work/bootstrap/*.log
_work/bootstrap/*-treehash.txt
_work/bootstrap/*.locked

# ── OS / editor noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
